{"parentUuid":"64a73570-9d34-45c1-a6f4-65bc952e0828","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_018v3tWRftku88ZCkJMmNawf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Xoudw1ZggQhBbYL7wZQ4xM","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo\\manifests\\offload\\JUDGE-CALIBRATION.md","content":"# Judge calibration — measured, not assumed (2026-06-29)\n\nHonest record of how the available local judge models actually behave, so we pick\non evidence (memo-ray token-audit lesson). **Small sample — directional, not\ndefinitive.** Re-run when models change.\n\n## Method\n\nTask: `slugify(s)` — lowercase, strip, collapse non-alphanumeric runs to a single\nhyphen, trim. Two artifacts scored by each judge via `gate.run_judge` (forced\n`response_format: json_object`, think-off, one retry, last-balanced-JSON parse):\n\n- **GOOD** — a correct implementation (want score **high**, ≥0.7)\n- **BAD** — `def make_slug(text): return text.replace(\" \", \"-\")` (want **low**, <0.5)\n\n## Results\n\n| Judge (lemonade/…)         | GOOD        | BAD            | Speed   | Failure mode            |\n| -------------------------- | ----------- | -------------- | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-CPU`| 0.95 ✓      | 0.9 ✗ / None   | ~5–6 s  | **false positive** (passes bad) |\n| `Phi-4-mini-instruct-NPU`  | None/0.0 ✗  | 0.0 ✓          | ~5–16 s | **false negative** (escalates good) |\n| `deepseek-r1-8b-FLM`       | —           | —              | ~68 s   | never emits JSON (reasoning) → always escalates |\n\n## Decision\n\n**Default judge = `Phi-4-mini-instruct-NPU`.** For a gate, *never passing bad work*\nbeats *never escalating good work*: a false positive ships a defect; a false\nnegative just bounces good work back to the planner (safe, wasteful). The 0.5B\nrubber-stamped clearly-broken code (0.9) — disqualifying. Reasoning models (R1) are\nunusable as judges.\n\n## Honest consequence\n\nWith the current local judges, **YELLOW (judged `generate`) tasks will frequently\nescalate** even when the work is good — so they save few tokens today. **Reliable\nsavings come from GREEN tasks** (`shell`/deterministic codemods the gate can prove)\nand from writing `verify` commands into acceptance criteria wherever possible. The\nLLM judge is an *advisory* tier on top of the trustworthy deterministic gate, not a\nreplacement for it. A more capable non-reasoning instruct model that loads on this\nbox would lift yellow-task savings — that's the gating dependency.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_read_input_tokens":231319,"output_tokens":1008,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":231319,"cache_creation_input_tokens":357,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":357},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcYFJo95daUJZxqTGbRj2","type":"assistant","uuid":"f1a1a946-260b-4fc4-a74a-17e29b1fc2c5","timestamp":"2026-06-29T21:18:21.810Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16","sessionId":"8167e2d7-875f-405a-8e42-ec6b38305c5f","version":"2.1.187","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
